  "description": "You riding this weekend? The Boulevard is the perfect bike for you. Comes with our Fully sealed rear wheel and our aftermarket La Mesa tires. Another great added bonus is our new 1978 Brake set with bridge spring, very light and responsive. Finishing off this pro looking bike we added the fat 1-Piece seat and post. You know you are riding this weekend!\nFull hi-ten frame with integrated head tube, Mid BB shell and 20.5\" top tube\nFull hi-ten fork with tapered legs\nHi-ten 8.50\" bars with Haro 1978 alloy top load stem\nHaro 1978 3-piece chromoly 8-spline 175mm cranks with sealed Mid BB\n25/9 gearing with sealed bearing rear hub and driver\nHaro La Mesa tires 2.4\" front and rear\nHaro padded one piece seat with built-in alloy post\nHaro Team grips\nHaro 1978 alloy brakes with hinge clamp lever",
